{"model":"fixture-model","max_tokens":32000,"messages":[{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"COMPACT_SEED_INPUT_731","cache_control":{"type":"ephemeral"}}]},{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder version=\"1\" category=\"capability\" source=\"mcp\" kind=\"connection_summary\" severity=\"info\" delivery=\"configurable\" audiences=\"[&quot;model&quot;,&quot;tui&quot;,&quot;diagnostics&quot;]\" summary=\"&quot;MCP: 6 connected, 0 failed, 0 disabled&quot;\" metadata=\"{}\">MCP: 6 connected, 0 failed, 0 disabled\n- artifact (connected, 1 tools)\n- cron (connected, 5 tools)\n- monitor (connected, 4 tools)\n- web (connected, 2 tools)\n- workflow (connected, 9 tools)\n- workspace (connected, 7 tools)\n\n已直接注入的 system MCP 工具按原始名称调用；其余 MCP 工具经 tool search 发现，名称格式为 mcp__&lt;server&gt;__&lt;tool&gt;。</system-reminder>","cache_control":{"type":"ephemeral"}}]},{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"ORIGINAL_LONG_REPLY_731 history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail history detail hist